    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019re home alone\u2026 but are you really alone?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the unsettling world of a teenager left to fend for themselves in a quiet suburban home. With your parents out of town, you expect a peaceful night, but what begins as mundane chores quickly spirals into a harrowing fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Storytelling</strong>: Experience a suspenseful narrative that unfolds in real-time, keeping you on edge with every step. Each choice you make could mean the difference between life and death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Gameplay</strong>: No two playthroughs are the same. Necessary items for survival and The Stalker will always spawn in pre-determined random locations to ensure each playthrough is unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Survival</strong>: Stay sharp and use common sense to outsmart The Stalker. Audio queues are important to uncovering which rooms are safe and unsafe. Pay attention to any clues that there may be someone lurking around the corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Atmosphere</strong>: The comfort of the home will be cut short. Every creak, knock, and distant footstep will keep you on edge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This psychological survival horror game delivers a gripping blend of fear, strategy, and discovery. Whether you\u2019re fortifying your home, searching for vital tools, or making a desperate run for safety, <strong>Stalked in Solitude</strong>\u00a0will keep you guessing until the very end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you prepared to face what\u2019s lurking in the dark? </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019re home alone\u2026 but are you really alone?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the unsettling world of a teenager left to fend for themselves in a quiet suburban home. With your parents out of town, you expect a peaceful night, but what begins as mundane chores quickly spirals into a harrowing fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Storytelling</strong>: Experience a suspenseful narrative that unfolds in real-time, keeping you on edge with every step. Each choice you make could mean the difference between life and death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Gameplay</strong>: No two playthroughs are the same. Necessary items for survival and The Stalker will always spawn in pre-determined random locations to ensure each playthrough is unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Survival</strong>: Stay sharp and use common sense to outsmart The Stalker. Audio queues are important to uncovering which rooms are safe and unsafe. Pay attention to any clues that there may be someone lurking around the corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Atmosphere</strong>: The comfort of the home will be cut short. Every creak, knock, and distant footstep will keep you on edge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This psychological survival horror game delivers a gripping blend of fear, strategy, and discovery. Whether you\u2019re fortifying your home, searching for vital tools, or making a desperate run for safety, <strong>Stalked in Solitude</strong>\u00a0will keep you guessing until the very end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you prepared to face what\u2019s lurking in the dark? </p>",
